    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it's not just a \"mistake\" though. it's who i am. i keep thinking about how much better everyone would be if i just wasn't part of the equation anymore. like, i'm not just struggling, i'm actually just causing harm by existing. how do you tell someone that they're fundamentally broken and there's no point in trying to fix it?",
